{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>One A Day 95%高純水晶魚油60粒裝（One A Day 95% Purity Fish Oil）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧及HKTVmall共3間零售商的網店報價。以同款兩盒商品總額計，最低與次低相差HK$209.5，約25%。</p>\n<h2>One A Day 95%高純水晶魚油60粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>兩盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜萬寧</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$419</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$628.5</strong></td>\n<td><strong>第二件半價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$419</td>\n<td>HK$838</td>\n<td>按單盒價計</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HKTVmall</td>\n<td>HK$434</td>\n<td>HK$868</td>\n<td>按單盒價計</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>One A Day 95%高純水晶魚油60粒裝兩盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>只買一盒，屈臣氏及萬寧的同款網上標價最低，為HK$419。買兩盒，萬寧的第二件半價總額為HK$628.5，與屈臣氏以「按單盒標價推算」計算的HK$838相差HK$209.5。平均每盒約HK$314.3。按單盒標價計的多件總額只供比較，實際結帳價、可買數量及供應以商戶為準。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月12日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/one-a-day-one-a-day%C2%AE-95-%E9%AB%98%E7%B4%94%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%AD%9A%E6%B2%B9/p/BP_824894\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/one-a-day-95-purity-fish-oil-60-capsules/p/582817\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/%E6%8B%9C%E8%80%B3%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E5%BA%97/s/H1179001/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E5%BF%83%E8%87%9F%E8%A1%80%E7%AE%A1%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7/95-%E9%AB%98%E7%B4%94%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E9%AD%9A%E6%B2%B9-/p/H0888001_S_10167983\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a></p>\n<p>魚油提供 EPA 和 DHA，兩者都是奧米加3脂肪酸。奧米加3脂肪酸是人體細胞膜的組成成分。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Omega3FattyAcids-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">美國國立衞生研究院奧米加3資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高同數量總額－較低同數量總額）÷較高同數量總額×100%。本次以（HK$838－HK$628.5）÷HK$838×100%計，約25%。較高總額按「按單盒標價推算」計，較低總額採用表列優惠。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944160260904022_19850561716af49d9a82a58.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"One A Day 95%高純水晶魚油60粒裝格價：萬寧 HK$628.5，兩盒約平25%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944160260904022_19850561716af49d9a82a58.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到One A Day 95%高純水晶魚油60粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月12日網上報價，萬寧的兩盒商品總額為HK$628.5。條件為第二件半價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>本次只比較標示95%高純水晶魚油、每盒60粒的版本。魚類過敏或正服用抗凝血藥的人士，選購前宜核對標籤並先詢問醫護。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T17:01:44.685860+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":888,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T16:53:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T17:15:23.525224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:55:08.969748+00:00","content_hash":"a12a32359c4288ccb8f0fe2dfa7b4165aac94588460476c441c6a7fb9d740792","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}